WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.421
NICK FURY
You've become part of a bigger universe.

00:00:03.472 --> 00:00:05.522
You just don't know it yet.

00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:07.674
YONDU UDONTA
Let's go get 'em, boys!

00:00:07.929 --> 00:00:09.491
HULK
[Roars]

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:18.363
NICK FURY
Nick Fury. I'm here to talk to you

00:00:18.414 --> 00:00:20.028
about the Avenger Initiative.

00:00:22.011 --> 00:00:23.273
There was an idea...

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:26.318
...to bring together
remarkable people...

00:00:27.727 --> 00:00:29.945
...see if they could
become something more.

